OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after four-vehicle
OL,4,Acollision on Highland road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after a four-vehicle
OL,7,Fcrash on the A9, near Cromarty Bridge.
OL,9,FPolice Scotland said the collision
OL,10,Fhappened at about 08:05 on Friday at
OL,11,FCoulnagower.
OL,13,FOfficers said it involved a blue Dacia
OL,14,FSandero, a white Iveco lorry, a blue
OL,15,FVolkswagen Scirocco and a red BMW X6.
OL,17,FThe driver of the Dacia, who has not
OL,18,Fbeen named, was pronounced dead at the
OL,19,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
